鸣之忠，非忠意也。今牧犯而不校，还而不取，可以为难矣，未得为仁让也。夫圣人以德报德，以直报怨，而牧欲以德报怨，非也。必不得已，二者何从？吾从孔子也。”","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line093-pei03-01:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"徐众","kind":"person","person_id":"wod_cwr_976","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line093-pei03-01:m0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"牧","kind":"person","person_id":"2ue_nmk_m3s_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line093-pei03-01:m0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"牧","kind":"person","person_id":"2ue_nmk_m3s_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line093-pei03-01:m0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"原宪","kind":"person","person_id":"b26_2bj_z9b","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line093-pei03-01:m0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line093-pei03-01:m0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line093-pei03-01:m0140","start":140,"end":141,"surface":"牧","kind":"person","person_id":"2ue_nmk_m3s_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line093-pei03-01:m0183","start":183,"end":186,"surface":"苍梧浇","kind":"person","person_id":"tcx_5ia_phu","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line093-pei03-01:m0196","start":196,"end":198,"surface":"尾生","kind":"person","person_id":"l3n_6lt_37x","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"